{"id":"vod_lz_66400","vodId":"66400","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"暗杀教室第一季","name_cn":"暗杀教室第一季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230712-1/fcb4b2aa7a2368eda438b0fae6974b8f.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在椚丘中学三年E班，表面上，这是一个普通的班级，然而实际上，这里聚集着的均是技艺高超冷酷无情的杀手。每一年，他们通过特殊渠道接收着来自世界各地的暗杀任务，替各国首脑“排忧解难”，而这一次，他们有了一个统一的目标——刺杀班主任杀老师（福山润 配音）。　　杀老师是一个神奇的存在，它的外表并非人类，却有着及其敏感的神经和及其迅速的反应力，没有人知道它从哪里来，也没有人知道，它为何会变成三年E班的班主任。因为想要毁灭地球，杀老师成为了暗杀名单上的高价悬赏人物，而作为三年E班的学生，只要成功消灭杀老师，即可毕业。就这样，围绕着这位神秘的老师，充满了危险的日常就此展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-07-12 12:47:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":22,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22973_78c58b91/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22971_4afa94c1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22970_3142a856/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22972_39dbd38e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22974_5723d8a2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22975_e3231a0f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22976_e0f2c31c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22977_e4564ef2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22978_ff0c13c5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22979_5217e265/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22980_d83b89c6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22981_5cdf5ac6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22985_c4f522d8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230710/22982_f45bbfec/index.m3u8"},{"name"